rem Investigating in how many Ways
rem Objects of Two Different Colours can
rem be Grouped
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=181
rem Count the ways to split Black black
rem and White white objects into groups,
rem when the order of groups and of
rem objects of one colour is ignored

use sequences
use io
use cli

arg Black integer = 40
arg White integer = 60

rem Cnt[b, w] counts the splittings of b
rem black and w white objects by the
rem group types met so far. Allowing a
rem type (db, dw) any number of times
rem multiplies by 1 + m + m^2 + ..., m
rem the shift by that type, which is
rem (1 + m) (1 + m^2) (1 + m^4) ...
Nb = Black
Nw = White
Rows = Nb + 1
Cols = Nw + 1
Cnt = array shape Rows Cols fill 0
Cnt 0 0 = 1
for Db in 0 to Nb
  for Dw in 0 to Nw
    Ok = Db + Dw greater 0
    Bx = Db
    By = Dw
    for Ok and Bx at most Nb
      if By greater Nw
        break
      end
      Down = Cnt shift Bx axis 0
      Moved = Down shift By axis 1
      Cnt = (Cnt + Moved) copy
      Bx *= 2
      By *= 2
    end
  end
end
Answer = Cnt Nb Nw
Answer print
